[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9067.91, "timestamp": "02:31:07", "text": "呃，有点像用弓箭手之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9068.79, "timestamp": "02:31:08", "text": "把它放下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9070.389, "timestamp": "02:31:10", "text": "你需要激活星形形态才能使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9071.429, "timestamp": "02:31:11", "text": "射手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9075.349, "timestamp": "02:31:15", "text": "所以这是两项技能，对吧？或者行动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9077.19, "timestamp": "02:31:17", "text": "呃，就像当你打开电源的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9079.349, "timestamp": "02:31:19", "text": "星形形态，你可以选择其中一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9080.87, "timestamp": "02:31:20", "text": "事物。比如你选弓箭手，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9085.11, "timestamp": "02:31:25", "text": "准备召唤弓箭手之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9087.99, "timestamp": "02:31:27", "text": "哪个危害更大？我认为是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9091.83, "timestamp": "02:31:31", "text": "2D。 2D意味着更大的伤害，对吧？二"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9093.51, "timestamp": "02:31:33", "text": "骰子是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9094.87, "timestamp": "02:31:34", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9097.99, "timestamp": "02:31:37", "text": "骰子之神允许你拿很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9099.19, "timestamp": "02:31:39", "text": "损害。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9101.75, "timestamp": "02:31:41", "text": "是的。是的。只有骰子之神才能做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9104.79, "timestamp": "02:31:44", "text": "可以造成伤害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9105.51, "timestamp": "02:31:45", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9107.83, "timestamp": "02:31:47", "text": "耶稣。释放耶稣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9111.03, "timestamp": "02:31:51", "text": "呃，好的。等等，我的月光光束已激活。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9111.99, "timestamp": "02:31:51", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9116.63, "timestamp": "02:31:56", "text": "是的。所以我可以控制它或重新触发"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9117.59, "timestamp": "02:31:57", "text": "它或者别的什么东西。"}, {"type":